# D1: in-flight ES auto-tune of the roll/pitch rate loops (livetune loop=rate, CMA-ES, WP-28): gyroxPID/gyroyPID Kp, Ki,
# Kd, the same values on roll and pitch (idx 9-14). One candidate per 6.5 s window: write the gains, settle 2.5 s, a
# 1-8 Hz 30 deg/s chirp, score the rate error. Starts from the firmware defaults (5/0.01/10), trust 0.3; every end writes
# the defaults back, the best gains are only reported (8081 says the summary line). MRAC injection off. fusion 2: each
# chirp re-zeroes the flow origin. Budget 85 s = baseline + 7 candidates on roll, then pitch. All values PROPOSED.
# Plan: docs/lab/run-sheet-2026-10-16.md
campaign lab-d-livetune-rate
rate 100
log velocity_loops camera_fusion
set g_xy_ctrl_kind=0 g_traj_ff_shift_s=0 g_land_xy_gate_cm=10
takeoff 0.5
hold 2
livetune loop=rate axes=[roll,pitch] budget_s=85
hold 1
land
